bugsplat provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-bugsplat CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::bugsplat::bugsplat)

Headers are installed under the bugsplat/ subdirectory:

    #include <bugsplat/BugSplat.h>

Only the release redistributable is staged beside an application, so every
configuration links against it. find_package also sets BUGSPLAT_TOOLS_DIR to the
directory holding BsSndRpt64.exe and the symbol upload helpers.
